      "id": 1,
      "text": "Seymour sprouted in the 1830s when the Illinois, Bloomington, and Western Railroad cut through the prairie, turning the area into a rail hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
