      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Major League Baseball pitcher Jeff Pfeffer was born in Seymour in 1888 and went on to win 158 games, including a 25‑win season with the Brooklyn Dodgers.",
